# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Packages for: Debian trixie + Xfce 4.20 + Armbian *edge* kernel (7.x)
# Variant WITHOUT the Armbian framework: no armbian-firmware, no armbian-bsp-*,
# no armbian-config. Firmware is Debian's, the kernel is Armbian's.
# Used by build-edge-xfce.yml (edge / 7.x), see lb-config-trixie-edge-xfce.sh.
#
# Difference to additional-packages.trixie-edge (the KDE variants): same base,
# same firmware, same kernel, but the desktop is Xfce on X11 with lightdm
# instead of Plasma 6 on Wayland with sddm. Xfce has no Qt/KF6 stack, so the
# LibreOffice/Xfce/GTK integration packages replace the KDE ones.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

